  "remarks": "JSC “Scientific and production association of automation named by academician N.A. Semikhatov” is a company active in the field of development and production of control systems and radio-electronic equipment for rocket and space technology, and industrial automation. The company develops and produces components for intercontinental and maritime ballistic missiles, as well as carriers of Soyuz-2, Bulava, Syneva rockets.",
